WEBVTT

00:11:26.708 --> 00:11:30.033
who understand that social justice
belongs to us all.

00:11:30.423 --> 00:11:32.400
And that wakes me up every morning,

00:11:32.424 --> 00:11:34.231
and that makes me fight even harder.

00:11:34.931 --> 00:11:39.200
Because I am moving forward,
knowing what is in my past.

00:11:39.224 --> 00:11:41.395
I know the obstacles they have for me.

00:11:41.419 --> 00:11:43.029
I know what they're going to do,

00:11:43.053 --> 00:11:47.022
and I'm fairly certain they're energizing
and creating new obstacles now.

00:11:47.046 --> 00:11:49.482
But they've got four years
to figure it out.

00:11:49.506 --> 00:11:50.974
(Laughter)

00:11:50.998 --> 00:11:56.044
(Applause)

00:11:56.068 --> 00:11:57.218
Maybe two.

00:11:57.568 --> 00:12:00.039
(Cheers)